
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@userId = 5
@invalidUserId = 999999

### 1. Get the existing post count before testing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/users/{{userId}}/post-count


### 2. TRANSACTION: Successful post creation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/transaction-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Transaction Success Test",
  "content": "This post should be saved.",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}


### 3. TRANSACTION: Force failure after INSERT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/transaction-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Transaction Rollback Test",
  "content": "This post must not persist.",
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "simulateFailure": true
}


### 4. TRANSACTION: Verify rollback
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/users/{{userId}}/post-count


### 5. TRANSACTION: Invalid user ID (foreign key violation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/transaction-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid User Transaction",
  "content": "This should fail.",
  "userId": {{invalidUserId}}
}


### 6. TRANSACTION: Missing title
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/transaction-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Title is missing.",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}


### 7. TRANSACTION: Empty title
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/transaction-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "content": "Content is present.",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}


### 8. TRANSACTION: Title exceeds 200 characters
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/transaction-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This title is intentionally longer than the maximum allowed length of two hundred characters so that the request should be rejected by the Express validation before any database insert can happen. Extra characters are included here to exceed the limit.",
  "content": "Testing title length.",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}


### 9. TRANSACTION: Invalid user ID type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/transaction-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid User Type",
  "content": "User ID should be an integer.",
  "userId": "abc"
}


### 10. STORED PROCEDURE: Successful post creation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/procedure-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Stored Procedure Success",
  "content": "Created using a PostgreSQL procedure.",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}


### 11. STORED PROCEDURE: Force failure after INSERT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/procedure-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Stored Procedure Rollback",
  "content": "This post must not persist.",
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "simulateFailure": true
}


### 12. STORED PROCEDURE: Invalid user ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/procedure-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Procedure Invalid User",
  "content": "This should fail due to the foreign key.",
  "userId": {{invalidUserId}}
}


### 13. STORED PROCEDURE: Missing content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/procedure-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Missing Content",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}


### 14. STORED PROCEDURE: Invalid failure flag type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/procedure-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Failure Flag",
  "content": "Testing request validation.",
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "simulateFailure": "true"
}


### 15. STORED PROCEDURE: Title exceeds 200 characters
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/procedure-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This title is intentionally longer than the maximum allowed length of two hundred characters so that the request should be rejected by the Express validation before any database insert can happen. Extra characters are included here to exceed the limit.",
  "content": "Testing title length.",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}


### 16. STORED FUNCTION: Get actual post count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/users/{{userId}}/post-count


### 17. STORED FUNCTION: Invalid user ID in URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/users/abc/post-count


### 18. STORED FUNCTION: Zero user ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/optimization/users/0/post-count
